  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/659/659-48.htm",
  "statuteText": "659:48 Death of a Voter. –\n\nIf the officers charged with the duty of processing absentee ballots are cognizant of the fact that the voter has died prior to the opening of the polls, they shall not open the envelope containing the absentee ballot."
}
